#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:6
msgid ""
"There are several ways to save a <application>Gnumeric</application> "
"workbook that is currently open."
msgstr ""
"Det finns flera sätt att spara en öppen arbetsbok i "
"<application>Gnumeric</application>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:11
msgid ""
"Existing files can be saved directly but this process does not allow a user "
"to change any settings to the file creation process."
msgstr ""
"Befintliga filer kan sparas direkt, men då går det inte att ändra "
"inställningarna för hur filen skapas."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:17
msgid "Saving files directly"
msgstr "Spara filer direkt"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:24
msgid "Three alternative ways to save a file directly"
msgstr "Tre sätt att spara en fil direkt"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:30
msgid ""
"Select, in the <guimenu><accel>F</accel>ile</guimenu> menu, the "
"<guimenuitem><accel>S</accel>ave</guimenuitem> menu item."
msgstr ""
"Välj i menyn <guimenu><accel>F</accel>il</guimenu> menyalternativet "
"<guimenuitem><accel>S</accel>para</guimenuitem>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:41
msgid ""
"Click on the <guibutton>Save</guibutton> button: <guiicon> "
"<inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/button-"
"save.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of "
"the file save button.</phrase> </textobject> </inlinemediaobject> </guiicon>"
msgstr ""
"Klicka på knappen <guibutton>Spara</guibutton>: <guiicon> "
"<inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/button-"
"save.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av "
"knappen för att spara filen.</phrase> </textobject> </inlinemediaobject> "
"</guiicon>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:61
msgid ""
"Type the combination <keycombo> <keysym>Ctrl</keysym><keysym>s</keysym> "
"</keycombo>, typing both keys simultaneously."
msgstr ""
"Tryck samtidigt på tangenterna <keycombo> "
"<keysym>Ctrl</keysym><keysym>s</keysym> </keycombo>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:18
msgid ""
"If the workbook has already been saved to a file or if the workbook was "
"opened from a file that already existed, <application>Gnumeric</application>"
" will simply overwrite the file with the newer version. <_:variablelist-1/> "
"Each of these approaches will save the file directly, allowing no "
"intervention on the part the user. If the file has been newly created, "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> will automatically launch the "
"<interface>Save As...</interface> dialog asking the user for a file name and"
" other configuration options for the file, as is explained below."
msgstr ""
"Om arbetsboken redan har sparats i en fil, eller öppnades från en befintlig "
"fil, skriver <application>Gnumeric</application> över filen med den nya "
"versionen. <_:variablelist-1/> Med alla dessa metoder sparas filen direkt "
"utan att du behöver göra något mer. Om arbetsboken är ny öppnar "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> automatiskt dialogrutan <interface>Spara"
" som...</interface>, där du får ange filnamn och andra inställningar för "
"filen, enligt beskrivningen nedan."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:83
msgid ""
"Users wishing to save an existing file to a new file must invoke the "
"<interface>Save As...</interface> dialog. The <interface>Save "
"As...</interface> dialog can be invoked at any time to save the current "
"workbook to a new file with either a different name or a different file "
"format type. This dialog is automatically launched when a user attempts to "
"use one of the methods described above to save a workbook which does not "
"already have an existing file."
msgstr ""
"Om du vill spara en befintlig fil som en ny fil öppnar du dialogrutan "
"<interface>Spara som...</interface>. Du kan öppna dialogrutan "
"<interface>Spara som...</interface> när som helst för att spara den aktuella"
" arbetsboken i en ny fil med ett annat namn eller filformat. Dialogrutan "
"öppnas automatiskt om du använder någon av metoderna ovan för att spara en "
"arbetsbok som ännu inte har någon fil."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:93
msgid ""
"The <interface>Save As...</interface> dialog asks the user to provide a name"
" for the file to be created, to select a folder in which to place the new "
"file, and to select a file format type for the file."
msgstr ""
"I dialogrutan <interface>Spara som...</interface> anger du filnamn, väljer "
"en mapp där filen ska sparas och väljer filformat."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:101
msgid "The steps required to save a file to a standard location."
msgstr "Så sparar du en fil på en standardplats."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:108
msgid "Launch the <interface>File Save</interface> dialog."
msgstr "Öppna dialogrutan <interface>Spara fil</interface>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:111
msgid ""
"In the <guimenu>File</guimenu> menu, select the <guimenuitem>Save "
"As</guimenuitem> menu item."
msgstr ""
"Välj i menyn <guimenu>Arkiv</guimenu> alternativet <guimenuitem>Spara "
"som</guimenuitem>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:117
msgid "Name the file. Open the folder containing the desired file."
msgstr "Namnge filen och öppna mappen där den ska sparas."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:120
msgid "In the text entry area, enter the file name."
msgstr "Ange filnamnet i textfältet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:125
msgid "Select the desired folder in which to save the file."
msgstr "Välj mappen där filen ska sparas."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:128
msgid "Select one of the standard locations to open the file."
msgstr "Välj en standardplats för filen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:133
msgid "Specify a file format type."
msgstr "Ange filformat."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:138
msgid "Click on the <guibutton>Save</guibutton> button."
msgstr "Klicka på knappen <guibutton>Spara</guibutton>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:146
msgid ""
"The remainder of this section explains these steps in greater detail, first,"
" by describing the components in the <interface>File Save</interface> dialog"
" and, then, by explaining each of the steps above in greater detail."
msgstr ""
"Resten av avsnittet beskriver stegen mer ingående. Först går vi igenom "
"komponenterna i dialogrutan <interface>Spara fil</interface> och därefter "
"varje steg ovan."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:155
msgid "Using the <interface>File Save</interface> dialog."
msgstr "Använda dialogrutan <interface>Spara fil</interface>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:157
msgid ""
"Saving a workbook to a file can be a simple process, depending on the folder"
" in which the file is to be saved. If this folder is in the predefined list "
"of standard folders and user bookmark folders, the file can be created with "
"the compact <interface>File Save</interface> dialog. The components of the "
"compact <interface>File Save</interface> dialog and the procedure to save a "
"workbook to a file in the predefined list of folders are explained next."
msgstr ""
"Det kan vara enkelt att spara en arbetsbok, beroende på vilken mapp filen "
"ska ligga i. Om mappen finns i listan över standardmappar eller användarens "
"bokmärkesmappar kan du skapa filen i den kompakta dialogrutan "
"<interface>Spara fil</interface>. Nedan beskrivs komponenterna i den "
"kompakta dialogrutan <interface>Spara fil</interface> och hur du sparar en "
"arbetsbok i en av mapparna i listan."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:169
msgid ""
"However, when the workbook is to be saved to a file created in a folder "
"which is not in the preselected list, the expanded <interface>File "
"Save</interface> dialog will be required. The components of the expanded "
"<interface>File Save</interface> dialog, the procedure for saving files in a"
" different folder, and an explanation of bookmark folders and their use are "
"given further below."
msgstr ""
"Om arbetsboken ska sparas i en mapp som inte finns i listan måste du använda"
" den utfällda dialogrutan <interface>Spara fil</interface>. Nedan beskrivs "
"komponenterna i den utfällda dialogrutan <interface>Spara fil</interface>, "
"hur du sparar filer i en annan mapp samt bokmärkesmappar och hur de används."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:181
msgid "The components of the compact <interface>File Save</interface> dialog."
msgstr ""
"Komponenterna i den kompakta dialogrutan <interface>Spara fil</interface>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:186
msgid ""
"The <interface>File Save</interface> dialog allows the user to save a "
"workbook into a new file but requires that the user provide a name for the "
"file, select the folder in which to save the file, and select a file format "
"type to use for this file. This dialog also provides a way to navigate the "
"folder hierarchy as will be explained further below."
msgstr ""
"I dialogrutan <interface>Spara fil</interface> sparar du arbetsboken i en ny"
" fil. Du anger filnamn, väljer mapp och filformat. Dialogrutan låter dig "
"också navigera i mapphierarkin, vilket beskrivs längre fram."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:195
msgid ""
"The <interface>File Save</interface> dialog first opens in a compact layout."
" The different areas of the dialog in this compact layout are shown and "
"labeled in <xref linkend=\"fig-file-save-dialog-compact-components\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Dialogrutan <interface>Spara fil</interface> öppnas först i ett kompakt "
"läge. Områdena i dialogrutan visas och märks ut i <xref linkend=\"fig-file-"
"save-dialog-compact-components\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:203
msgid "The compact form of the <interface>File Save</interface> dialog."
msgstr "Den kompakta dialogrutan <interface>Spara fil</interface>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:214
msgid ""
"This screenshot depicts the 'File Save' dialog in its compact form with the "
"different areas labeled."
msgstr ""
"Den här skärmbilden visar dialogrutan ”Spara fil” i kompakt läge med de "
"olika områdena utmärkta."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:228
msgid "The components of the compact <interface>File Save</interface> dialog"
msgstr ""
"Komponenterna i den kompakta dialogrutan <interface>Spara fil</interface>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:232
msgid "<emphasis role=\"bold\">A</emphasis> - The naming area."
msgstr "<emphasis role=\"bold\">A</emphasis> – Namnfältet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:237
msgid ""
"This area is used to give the file its name. This is a standard text entry "
"area allowing all the basic editing commands. The cursor can be moved left "
"or right using the keyboard arrow keys. The cursor can be placed anywhere in"
" the text by placing the mouse pointer where the cursor should go and "
"clicking with the primary mouse button. The mouse can also select part or "
"all of the text with a click and drag. The keyboard shortcuts for copying, "
"<keycombo><keysym>Ctrl</keysym><keysym>c</keysym></keycombo>, cutting, "
"<keycombo><keysym>Ctrl</keysym><keysym>x</keysym></keycombo>, or pasting, "
"<keycombo><keysym>Ctrl</keysym><keysym>v</keysym></keycombo>, all work. The "
"dialog uses filename matching to guess file names based on the files already"
" in the parent folder."
msgstr ""
"Här anger du filnamnet. Fältet är ett vanligt textfält med grundläggande "
"redigeringsfunktioner. Flytta markören med vänster- och högerpiltangenterna."
" Du kan placera markören var som helst i texten genom att klicka där med "
"primär musknapp. Du kan också markera en del av eller hela texten genom att "
"klicka och dra. Kortkommandona för att kopiera "
"(<keycombo><keysym>Ctrl</keysym><keysym>c</keysym></keycombo>), klippa ut "
"(<keycombo><keysym>Ctrl</keysym><keysym>x</keysym></keycombo>) och klistra "
"in (<keycombo><keysym>Ctrl</keysym><keysym>v</keysym></keycombo>) fungerar "
"också. Dialogrutan använder filnamnsmatchning för att föreslå namn utifrån "
"filerna i den överordnade mappen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:261
msgid "<emphasis role=\"bold\">B</emphasis> - The folder selection area."
msgstr "<emphasis role=\"bold\">B</emphasis> – Mappväljaren."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:266
msgid ""
"This area provides a drop down list of previously selected folders including"
" the standard folders and the folders which have been bookmarked by the "
"user. The area will be disabled if area <emphasis role=\"bold\">D</emphasis>"
" has been selected to expand the dialog."
msgstr ""
"Här finns en lista över tidigare valda mappar, däribland standardmappar och "
"mappar som användaren har bokmärkt. Om du har valt område <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">D</emphasis> och fällt ut dialogrutan är listan inaktiverad."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:274
msgid ""
"The desired folder can be selected by moving the mouse pointer over the "
"button, clicking and holding the primary mouse button, dragging the mouse "
"pointer onto the name of the desired folder and releasing the mouse button. "
"The new folder name will appear on as the name on the button."
msgstr ""
"Välj önskad mapp genom att hålla ned primär musknapp på knappen, dra pekaren"
" till mappnamnet och släppa knappen. Den valda mappen visas sedan på "
"knappen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:286
msgid ""
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">C</emphasis> - The file format type selection area."
msgstr "<emphasis role=\"bold\">C</emphasis> – Välj filformat."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:297 C/gnumeric.xml:554
msgid ""
"If the file format type named \"Text export (configurable)\" is opened, this"
" will start the text export procedure. <xref linkend=\"sect-file-"
"textExport\"/> explains this procedure in complete detail."
msgstr ""
"Om du väljer filformatet ”Textexport (konfigurerbar)” startar textexporten. "
"En fullständig beskrivning finns i <xref linkend=\"sect-file-textExport\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:309
msgid "<emphasis role=\"bold\">D</emphasis> - The dialog expansion area."
msgstr "<emphasis role=\"bold\">D</emphasis> – Fäll ut eller in dialogrutan."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:314
msgid ""
"This area will alter the dialog to expand or collapse it. When expanded the "
"dialog provides a way to select any folder accessible on the system, to "
"create new folders and to add and remove bookmark folders from the user's "
"bookmark folder list. When the dialog is expanded, the small arrow will "
"point downward, the areas showing in <xref linkend=\"fig-file-save-dialog-"
"expanded-components\"/> will appear and area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">B</emphasis> will be disabled."
msgstr ""
"Här fäller du ut eller in dialogrutan. I utfällt läge kan du välja valfri "
"mapp i systemet, skapa mappar och lägga till eller ta bort bokmärkesmappar. "
"När dialogrutan är utfälld pekar den lilla pilen nedåt, områdena i <xref "
"linkend=\"fig-file-save-dialog-expanded-components\"/> visas och område "
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">B</emphasis> inaktiveras."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:330
msgid "<emphasis role=\"bold\">E</emphasis> - The button area."
msgstr "<emphasis role=\"bold\">E</emphasis> – Knapparna."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:335
msgid ""
"This area provides two buttons, the <guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> and the "
"<guibutton>Save</guibutton> buttons. Clicking the "
"<guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> button will dismiss the dialog and return the "
"user to the worksheet. Clicking the <guibutton>Save</guibutton> button will "
"cause a file to be created with the currently selected name, parent folder "
"and format. If the selected file already exists, "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> will open a confirmation dialog since "
"the command will obliterate the previously existing file."
msgstr ""
"Här finns knapparna <guibutton>Avbryt</guibutton> och "
"<guibutton>Spara</guibutton>. Klicka på <guibutton>Avbryt</guibutton> för "
"att stänga dialogrutan och återgå till kalkylbladet. Med "
"<guibutton>Spara</guibutton> skapas en fil med det valda namnet, i den valda"
" mappen och med det valda formatet. Om filen redan finns visar "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> en bekräftelseruta, eftersom den "
"befintliga filen kommer att ersättas."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:224
msgid ""
"The purpose of each labeled area will be explained below: "
"<_:variablelist-1/>"
msgstr "Nedan förklaras syftet med varje märkt område: <_:variablelist-1/>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:358
msgid ""
"The procedure to save a file using this dialog in its compact form is "
"present next, in <xref linkend=\"sect-file-save-dialog-quickintro\"/>. The "
"components of the dialog in its expanded layout, converted by clicking in "
"area <emphasis role=\"bold\">D</emphasis> when the <interface>File "
"Save</interface> dialog is in its compact form, will be explained further "
"on, in <xref linkend=\"sect-file-save-dialog-expanded-components\"/>, "
"followed by sections explaining the use of the dialog in this expanded "
"layout."
msgstr ""
"Nästa avsnitt, <xref linkend=\"sect-file-save-dialog-quickintro\"/>, "
"beskriver hur du sparar en fil i dialogrutans kompakta läge. Komponenterna i"
" det utfällda läget, som visas när du klickar i område <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">D</emphasis> i dialogrutan <interface>Spara fil</interface>, "
"beskrivs längre fram i <xref linkend=\"sect-file-save-dialog-expanded-"
"components\"/>. Därefter följer avsnitt om hur det utfällda läget används."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:381
msgid "The basic file saving procedure."
msgstr "Grundläggande sätt att spara en fil."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:385
msgid ""
"Saving a workbook to a new file requires providing name the file, selecting "
"a folder in which the file will be placed, and selecting a file format type."
msgstr ""
"Så sparar du en arbetsbok i en ny fil: ange filnamn, välj en mapp och välj "
"filformat."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:391
msgid ""
"The default action, if a user simply opens the <interface>File "
"Save</interface> dialog and clicks on the <guibutton>Save</guibutton> "
"button, is to name the file <filename>Book1.gnumeric</filename> incrementing"
" the number for each new file created, to save the file in the user's home "
"folder, and to create a file in the <application>Gnumeric</application> file"
" format."
msgstr ""
"Om du öppnar dialogrutan <interface>Spara fil</interface> och klickar på "
"<guibutton>Spara</guibutton> får filen som standard namnet "
"<filename>Book1.gnumeric</filename>. Numret ökas för varje ny fil. Filen "
"sparas i hemmappen i <application>Gnumeric</application>-format."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:401
msgid ""
"If the user provides a name for the file to be saved which is the same as "
"the name of a file that already exists, <application>Gnumeric</application> "
"will open up a confirmation dialog asking the user if they really want to "
"overwrite the existing file. If the user then clicks on the "
"<guibutton>Yes</guibutton> button, the existing file will be destroyed and "
"the new file created in its place."
msgstr ""
"Om du anger ett filnamn som redan används visar "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> en bekräftelseruta och frågar om du vill"
" skriva över filen. Om du klickar på <guibutton>Ja</guibutton> ersätts den "
"befintliga filen med den nya."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:413
msgid "The procedure to save a file."
msgstr "Så sparar du en fil."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:416
msgid "Open the <interface>File Save</interface> dialog."
msgstr "Öppna dialogrutan <interface>Spara fil</interface>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:419
msgid ""
"First, the dialog must be opened using either of the two following methods:"
msgstr "Öppna först dialogrutan på något av följande två sätt:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:425
msgid ""
"Two alternative ways to open the <interface>File Save</interface> dialog."
msgstr "Två sätt att öppna dialogrutan <interface>Spara fil</interface>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:435
msgid ""
"Select, in the <guimenu><accel>F</accel>ile</guimenu> menu, the "
"<guimenuitem>S<accel>a</accel>ve as...</guimenuitem> menu item."
msgstr ""
"Välj i menyn <guimenu><accel>F</accel>il</guimenu> alternativet "
"<guimenuitem>Sp<accel>a</accel>ra som...</guimenuitem>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:448
msgid ""
"Type the combination <keycombo> <keysym>Shift</keysym> <keysym>Ctrl</keysym>"
" <keysym>s</keysym> </keycombo>, typing all three keys simultaneously."
msgstr ""
"Tryck samtidigt på <keycombo> <keysym>Shift</keysym> <keysym>Ctrl</keysym> "
"<keysym>s</keysym> </keycombo>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:461
msgid ""
"Both methods will launch the <interface>File Save</interface> dialog to "
"allow the user to name the file, select a folder (also called a directory) "
"for the file and choose a file format type. This dialog will also open "
"automatically the first time a new workbook is saved."
msgstr ""
"Båda metoderna öppnar dialogrutan <interface>Spara fil</interface>, där du "
"kan ange filnamn, välja mapp (katalog) och filformat. Dialogrutan öppnas "
"också automatiskt första gången du sparar en ny arbetsbok."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:473
msgid "Select a name for the file."
msgstr "Välj ett filnamn."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:476
msgid ""
"Next, a name must be given for the file. <application>Gnumeric</application>"
" provides a default name but, when the dialog is first opened this name is "
"highlighted indicating that it is already selected. Therefore, a user can "
"simply start typing a new name and the first character entered will delete "
"the name given by default. The file name field is presented as area "
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">A</emphasis> in <xref linkend=\"fig-file-save-"
"dialog-compact-components\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Ange sedan ett filnamn. <application>Gnumeric</application> föreslår ett "
"standardnamn som är markerat när dialogrutan öppnas. Börja skriva för att "
"ersätta det. Filnamnsfältet är område <emphasis role=\"bold\">A</emphasis> i"
" <xref linkend=\"fig-file-save-dialog-compact-components\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:487
msgid ""
"If typing a name does not have any effect, the 'focus' was probably "
"inadvertently changed from the text entry area. Focus can be returned to the"
" area by placing the mouse pointer over the box and clicking the primary "
"mouse button. All the standard keyboard editing commands work in this text "
"area and the mouse can be used to select text or to move the cursor "
"location."
msgstr ""
"Om inget händer när du skriver har fokus troligen flyttats från textfältet. "
"Återställ fokus genom att placera pekaren över fältet och klicka med primär "
"musknapp. Alla vanliga redigeringskommandon på tangentbordet fungerar här, "
"och du kan använda musen för att markera text eller flytta markören."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:500
msgid "Select a folder in which to save the file."
msgstr "Välj mappen där filen ska sparas."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:503
msgid ""
"Then, the folder in which to save the file can be chosen from the drop down "
"list shown as area <emphasis role=\"bold\">B</emphasis> in <xref "
"linkend=\"fig-file-save-dialog-compact-components\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Välj sedan mappen i listan i område <emphasis role=\"bold\">B</emphasis> i "
"<xref linkend=\"fig-file-save-dialog-compact-components\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:510
msgid ""
"Using this list requires placing the mouse pointer above the list button and"
" clicking with the primary mouse button to open the list. The desired folder"
" can then be selected by moving the pointer down the list and clicking again"
" with the primary mouse button. The second click will close the drop down "
"list and change the selected folder. Instead of the two mouse clicks, the "
"entire operation can be replaced by a click-hold, drag and release, where "
"the first mouse click is replaced by the click-and-hold and the second mouse"
" click is replaced by the release."
msgstr ""
"Öppna listan genom att placera pekaren över listknappen och klicka med "
"primär musknapp. Flytta sedan pekaren till önskad mapp och klicka igen. Det "
"andra klicket stänger listan och väljer mappen. Du kan också klicka och "
"hålla ned musknappen, dra pekaren till mappen och släppa knappen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:523
msgid ""
"This list only provides a limited number of choices including several "
"standard folders and any bookmark folders the user has previously added to "
"the file selector. Other folders can be chosen, new folders can be created, "
"and the list of bookmark folders available can be changed, by clicking in "
"area <emphasis role=\"bold\">D</emphasis> to change to the expanded dialog, "
"as will be explained further below, in <xref linkend=\"sect-file-save-"
"dialog-chdir\"/>, <xref linkend=\"sect-file-save-dialog-mkdir\"/> and <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-file-save-dialog-bookmarks\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Listan innehåller ett begränsat urval av standardmappar och bokmärkesmappar "
"som du tidigare har lagt till i filväljaren. Du kan välja andra mappar, "
"skapa mappar och ändra listan med bokmärkesmappar genom att fälla ut "
"dialogrutan i område <emphasis role=\"bold\">D</emphasis>. Detta beskrivs "
"längre fram i <xref linkend=\"sect-file-save-dialog-chdir\"/>, <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-file-save-dialog-mkdir\"/> och <xref linkend=\"sect-file-"
"save-dialog-bookmarks\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:539
msgid "Select a file type."
msgstr "Välj filtyp."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:543
msgid ""
"Next, the desired file type must be selected. Area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">C</emphasis> in <xref linkend=\"fig-file-save-dialog-compact-"
"components\"/> provides a drop down list of file types. The process for "
"using this list is the same as was described in the previous step. The file "
"types are listed below in <xref linkend=\"sect-file-save\"/> and explained "
"in detail in <xref linkend=\"sect-file-formats\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Välj sedan önskad filtyp i listan i område <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">C</emphasis> i <xref linkend=\"fig-file-save-dialog-compact-"
"components\"/>. Listan används på samma sätt som i föregående steg. "
"Filtyperna listas i <xref linkend=\"sect-file-save\"/> och beskrivs närmare "
"i <xref linkend=\"sect-file-formats\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:566
msgid "Click the <guibutton>Save</guibutton> button."
msgstr "Klicka på knappen <guibutton>Spara</guibutton>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:569
msgid ""
"Finally, the <guibutton>Save</guibutton> button must be pressed by placing "
"the mouse pointer over the button and clicking with the primary mouse "
"button."
msgstr "Avsluta genom att klicka på knappen <guibutton>Spara</guibutton>."
